# Central Command Jobs
job-description-nanotrasen-spectre = Complete your assigned tasks, Terminate the given targets. Good luck.
# Mentor Jobs
job-description-security-sergeant = Train security, advise the department, lead the charge into battle, die gloriously on the Frontline.
job-description-medical-medicus = Prevent malpractice, teach the interns, advise the department, and end up on the operating table when chemistry explodes.
job-description-engineering-foreman = Ensure construction runs smoothly, supervise the department, train new hires, be first to face the consequences of the loose.
job-description-cargo-bosun = Train cargo, advise the department, keep the silos filled and the budget in check, and come out mangled after experiencing the dangers of space.
job-description-science-professor = Teach science, advise the department, guide research, die painfully in the artifact chamber.
# Security Misc
job-description-transit-prisoner = A bureaucratic error caused your stay on this station. Bide your time in this layover confinement. Scheme with other inmates. Make the cadet regret walking into the brig.
# Cargo Jobs
job-description-courier = Ensure mail, parcel and materials are delivered to the crew.
job-description-logistics-assistant = Learn the basics of hauling cargo, handling the station's orders, and shuttle piloting.
